            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa muboolanga mbu Injila yOMWAMI shiyili ineng'aafu ta. Hulile bulaano, inywe abeinzu yaIsiraeli; mbu injila yanje shiyili ineng'aafu ta? Ne shitsili tsinjila tsieenywe etsibula obuleng'aafu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa omulunjis hi aba nashiukhana okhurula khubulunjishibwe nakhola obumayaanu, alafwa khulwabwo; alafwa khulwa obumayaanubwe obwa aba nakholile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi omundu omubii naba nashiukhana okhurula khububiibwe obwa yali nakholanga, nakhola akafuchiililwa, akali habwene, aleehonia abe mwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila aba nayililisiye, nashiukhana okhurula khubukhayibwe bwosi obwa yali nakholanga, kho okhuba mwoyo alaba mwoyo; shialafwa ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa abeinzu yaIsiraeli baboola mbu Injila yOMWAMI shiyili ineng'aafu ta. E inywe abeinzu yaIsiraeli, injila yanje shiyili ineng'aafu? Ne shitsili tsinjila tsieenywe etsibula obuleng'aafu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako ndalamuyaasia, inywe abeinzu yaIsiraeli, buli mundu tsinjilatsie shinga olwa tsili, Omwami NYASAYE aboola. Mwikalukhasie, nimushiukhana okhurula khubukhayi bweenywe bwosi, mbu obumayaanu buleshe okhumwisichirasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwibale obukhayi bweenywe obwa mukhayanga, nimwinyoolela omwoyo omuyia neiroho imbia; nishiina eshichila nimwenya okhufwa, inywe abeinzu yaIsiraeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba okhufwa khwa oyo oufwa shikhunjamisia ta, Omwami NYASAYE aboola; khulwako, mwikalukhasie, mube mwoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
